        <mxCell id="note_0" value="Precondition: booking detail is already loaded (UC-C12).&lt;br&gt;BookingDetailPage and its CancelDialog are in CustomerPages.tsx." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="134" width="481.7" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_1" value="Only this room is cancelled; sibling bookings remain unchanged.&lt;br&gt;Service, policy, payment, refund-request and audit work is folded into C.&lt;br&gt;No payOS refund network call exists; bank transfer is manual.&lt;br&gt;Email assumes NOTIFICATION_API_URL is configured; development can log mail.&lt;br&gt;The code logs delivery failure; no durable retry queue is implemented.&lt;br&gt;The saved status is CANCELLED, including cases awaiting refund approval." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="901.9" y="2560" width="1188.4" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
